00:08:21.580 --> 00:08:23.080
OK, back to Hop.

00:08:23.080 --> 00:08:28.150
Although I'm sure we're all relieved he and
Dmitri survived their encounter with the Demogorgon,

00:08:28.150 --> 00:08:32.839
there's still the pesky problem of how on
earth they're going to get back to the US.

00:08:32.839 --> 00:08:36.939
Yuri's plane crash-landed so there's no easy
way to get back to North America.

00:08:36.939 --> 00:08:41.649
However, there's a big clue on one of the
Season 4 posters which shows Hopper, Joyce

00:08:41.649 --> 00:08:46.360
and Murray approaching a gate to the Upside
Down inside the Russian prison.

00:08:46.360 --> 00:08:49.360
We know from Season 3 that the Russians opened
a gate themselves.

00:08:49.360 --> 00:08:54.480
In the Season 4 sneak-peek, there's a shot
of Hop going through a door with a flaming

00:08:54.480 --> 00:08:59.129
weapon and I think this is him returning to
the prison in search of the gate and armed

00:08:59.129 --> 00:09:01.939
with fire in case they encounter the Demogorgon.

00:09:01.939 --> 00:09:06.879
In fact, there's a special Volume 2 teaser
on Netflix that plays right after the end

00:09:06.879 --> 00:09:11.209
of the seventh episode credits which reveals
even more Hopper details.

00:09:11.209 --> 00:09:16.560
He enters a room with caged Demogorgons, though
it's not clear whether they're alive or dead.

00:09:16.560 --> 00:09:21.850
And then he and Murray stumble upon a glass
box filled with black particulates which appear

00:09:21.850 --> 00:09:27.009
to be like the black mist the Mind Flayer
used to possess Will in the second season.

00:09:27.009 --> 00:09:31.779
An interesting detail about Hopper's past
came up this season when he revealed new details

00:09:31.779 --> 00:09:34.730
about the tragic backstory of his daughter's
death.

00:09:34.730 --> 00:09:39.750
Hop explains to Dmitri that when he was in
Vietnam, he was heavily exposed to Agent Orange,

00:09:39.750 --> 00:09:43.360
a chemical used by the U.S. against the Viet
Cong during the war.

00:09:43.360 --> 00:09:47.029
And Hopper goes on to explain the horrors
of what happened when veterans from the war

00:09:47.029 --> 00:09:48.610
later had children.

00:09:48.610 --> 00:09:49.699
Kids born stillborn.

00:09:49.699 --> 00:09:51.149
Dead in the womb.

00:09:51.149 --> 00:09:53.139
Crooked spines, eyes popped out.

00:09:53.139 --> 00:09:58.279
That last point is especially chilling because
it's the same way that One or Vecna murders

00:09:58.279 --> 00:10:02.369
his victims, twisting their limbs and gouging
their eyes out.

00:10:02.369 --> 00:10:06.309
And, given the importance of the Rainbow Room
in the Stranger Things mythology, it can't

00:10:06.309 --> 00:10:10.899
be just a coincidence that the Duffer Brothers
came up with this particular storyline as

00:10:10.899 --> 00:10:15.740
Agent Orange is classified by the U.S. military
as a Rainbow Herbicide,

00:10:15.740 --> 00:10:20.339
in other words it was used in warfare, which
reminds me of the times that Eleven, a product

00:10:20.339 --> 00:10:24.230
of the Rainbow Room, has been referred to
as a weapon over the seasons.

00:10:24.230 --> 00:10:25.329
She's a weapon!

00:10:25.329 --> 00:10:27.810
Her baby's a weapon, off fighting the commies.

00:10:27.810 --> 00:10:32.959
In fact, the unethical use of chemicals for
military and other purposes is a recurring

00:10:32.959 --> 00:10:34.779
theme in the series.

00:10:34.779 --> 00:10:41.740
The Hawkins Lab was part of Project MKUltra,
a real-life CIA illegal operation that experimented

00:10:41.740 --> 00:10:47.050
with various psychedelic drugs and other chemicals
on subjects as part of biological warfare

00:10:47.050 --> 00:10:48.089
research.

00:10:48.089 --> 00:10:53.759
And in Season 3, both human and rat victims
of the Mind Flayer consumed toxic amounts

00:10:53.759 --> 00:10:58.051
of fertiliser and chemicals so that their
bodies would be physically weakened, and they

00:10:58.051 --> 00:11:02.839
would break down and melt easily before becoming
part of the Spider Monster.

00:11:02.839 --> 00:11:07.509
Hopper feels a huge sense of guilt about the
fact he knew he'd been exposed to Agent Orange

00:11:07.509 --> 00:11:09.860
and still decided to have a baby with his
wife.

00:11:09.860 --> 00:11:11.910
I knew the risks, but I hid them.

00:11:11.910 --> 00:11:14.949
And he believes he sentenced Sara to death
because of this

00:11:14.949 --> 00:11:16.700
Everyone I love, I hurt.

00:11:16.700 --> 00:11:17.740
I wasn't cursed.

00:11:17.740 --> 00:11:19.119
I am the curse.

00:11:19.119 --> 00:11:24.240
And Hop's words have clear parallels with
how his adopted daughter El sees herself as

00:11:24.240 --> 00:11:26.279
a monster at various points as well.

00:11:26.279 --> 00:11:28.139
I am a monster.

00:11:28.139 --> 00:11:32.089
Hopper's feelings of guilt are likely to come
back to haunt him in the second part of this

00:11:32.089 --> 00:11:36.990
season as Vecna could easily put him under
a curse by reminding him of this.

00:11:36.990 --> 00:11:41.620
I also think that Eddie could very well end
up sacrificing himself for the group by the

00:11:41.620 --> 00:11:43.269
end of Volume 2.

00:11:43.269 --> 00:11:47.149
He specifically brought up the point that
he's not normally very brave:

00:11:47.149 --> 00:11:50.180
Outside of D&amp;D, I am no hero.

00:11:50.180 --> 00:11:54.209
I see danger and I just turn heel and run.

00:11:54.209 --> 00:11:58.180
However, in the Season 4 trailer, there's
footage of him playing his guitar on top of

00:11:58.180 --> 00:12:03.089
a trailer in the Upside Down with a set of
loudspeakers playing at maximum volume.

00:12:03.089 --> 00:12:04.869
Sorry I'm late, sweetheart.

00:12:04.869 --> 00:12:06.660
[strums notes]
You're beautiful.

00:12:06.660 --> 00:12:11.250
This may be to blast out music in an effort
to break Nancy out of her trance, but it's

00:12:11.250 --> 00:12:16.360
also very dangerous as it will inevitably
attract attention from the Demobats and, in

00:12:16.360 --> 00:12:17.540
turn, Vecna.

00:12:17.540 --> 00:12:22.360
And in the Volume 2 teaser, there's footage
that reveals Nancy seemingly free with Robin

00:12:22.360 --> 00:12:24.730
and Steve wearing camouflage.

00:12:24.730 --> 00:12:28.939
Some more shots in the trailer and volume
2 teaser we haven't yet seen are this one

00:12:28.939 --> 00:12:34.269
of Erica in the Upside Down, and another of
Dustin who's also in the alternate dimension.

00:12:34.269 --> 00:12:39.740
There's this shot of Eleven standing in front
of the Nina Project as it blows up, and Mrs

00:12:39.740 --> 00:12:42.559
Wheeler and Holly terrified of something.

00:12:42.559 --> 00:12:46.829
Comment below if you have any theories on
what might be going on in these shots.

00:12:46.829 --> 00:12:49.310
There's also the mystery of Will's painting.

00:12:49.310 --> 00:12:52.470
Will is painting a lot, but he won't show
me what he's working on.

00:12:52.470 --> 00:12:53.839
Maybe it is for a girl.

00:12:53.839 --> 00:12:57.720
I think there is someone he likes, because
he has been acting weird.

00:12:57.720 --> 00:12:58.720
Uh, what's that?

00:12:58.720 --> 00:12:59.720
Um, it's nothing.

00:12:59.720 --> 00:13:01.339
Just this painting I've been working on.

00:13:01.339 --> 00:13:06.600
Will also grabs it in the fourth episode before
they have to escape with Argyle, so it's clearly

00:13:06.600 --> 00:13:07.600
important.

00:13:07.600 --> 00:13:11.930
We know Will has been possessed by the Mind
Flayer previously, and he drew a map of all

00:13:11.930 --> 00:13:15.889
the vast tunnel network the monster had created
beneath Hawkins.

00:13:15.889 --> 00:13:20.860
So I strongly suspect this painting will hold
a crucial clue to defeating Vecna.

00:13:20.860 --> 00:13:25.709
Eleven regaining her powers is also surely
crucial to defeating the villain, and now

00:13:25.709 --> 00:13:30.170
that she's remembered what really happened
at the Lab, perhaps she'll get some more answers

00:13:30.170 --> 00:13:31.240
from Brenner.

00:13:31.240 --> 00:13:35.440
She did briefly regain her powers at one point,
but then they immediately disappeared.

00:13:35.440 --> 00:13:38.499
You didn't think it would be that easy, did
you?

00:13:38.499 --> 00:13:40.149
I don't understand.

00:13:40.149 --> 00:13:41.149
I do.

00:13:41.149 --> 00:13:42.149
Papa.

